    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A monster-catching, <strong>dungeon-crawling</strong> RPG. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the role of Anza as he embarks on his journey to find the Archfiend Natas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:<strong> </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore a dangerous world with challenging battles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Capture and train unique monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Strategic gameplay with a Turn-Based Battle System.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Progress by leveling up your character and monsters, gaining powerful abilities.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quests provide a significant amount of EXP but are limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854280/extras/13526dd79a2bcb2188966b2b9f3fd7b3.avif?t=1746895271\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are various dungeons with different loot and stronger monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each dungeon type features random quests that can be completed to earn extra EXP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854280/extras/b9af487212c7a2926b9ca7294a92da18.avif?t=1746895271\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The overworld is semi-open. When you become strong enough, you can explore more areas.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A monster-catching, <strong>dungeon-crawling</strong> RPG. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the role of Anza as he embarks on his journey to find the Archfiend Natas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:<strong> </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore a dangerous world with challenging battles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Capture and train unique monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Strategic gameplay with a Turn-Based Battle System.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Progress by leveling up your character and monsters, gaining powerful abilities.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quests provide a significant amount of EXP but are limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854280/extras/13526dd79a2bcb2188966b2b9f3fd7b3.avif?t=1746895271\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are various dungeons with different loot and stronger monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each dungeon type features random quests that can be completed to earn extra EXP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854280/extras/b9af487212c7a2926b9ca7294a92da18.avif?t=1746895271\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The overworld is semi-open. When you become strong enough, you can explore more areas.</p>",
